Wed Nov 18 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - rodrigo@lyraos.com.br

- Initial package of Lyra Writer 0.1.0 (preview):
  * List whole removable USB disks from udisks2; internal disks,
    partitions and system devices are never shown.
  * Write a local ISO through udisks2 Block.OpenDevice (O_EXCL,
    polkit authorization), unmounting the stick first, without
    running as root.
  * Verify the written stick against the ISO by SHA-256.
  * Downloading the editions and restoring a stick are still
    simulated.
